{"response":{"recordings":[{"showDescription":"Šnofki so radovedna in igriva druščina štirih otrok, Julije, Janje, Vita in Nika , ki v družbi sanjavega glasbenika Alekseja in njegovega psička Polarisa raziskuje naravo. Mladi kmetovalci znajo zavihati rokave. Na kmetiji pri babici in dedku se lotijo raznovrstnih opravil in vsako spremenijo v zabavno dogodivščino. Šnofki širijo nalezljivo veselje do preživljanja časa na najbolj navdihujočih otroških igriščih: na cvetočih travnikih, v prostranih gozdovih, na sveže preoranih in zasajenih njivah in vrtovih.","score":"5062.877","title":"KO SI SREČEN, DVIGNI GRABLJE DO NEBA","duration":"33","views":"118","showName":"Šnofki","publishDate":"2026-03-30 11:00:00","description":"Zapoj s Šnofki!","showId":"173252090","viewTime":"1390","recordingDate":"2026-03-30 10:25:03","broadcast":{"language":["SLO"],"genre":["IZOBRAŽEVALNE VSEBINE","IZOBRAŽEVALNE ODDAJE","Šolsko izobraževanje","Osnovnošolsko izobraževanje"],"keywords":["Šnofki","pesem","Ko si srečen"],"genreIds":[110,11020,11020170,1102017020]},"id":"175210258","mediaType":"video","showTypeId":"31","showThumbnail":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173252090/logo_1.jpg","thumbnail_sec":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_archive11/Content/thumbnail/175210258/175210258_1.jpg","expirationDate":"3000-01-01 00:00:00","clip":"1","broadcastDate":"2026-03-28 00:00:00","media_thumbnails":[{"format_type":0,"id":545842,"link":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_archive11/Content/thumbnail/175210258/175210258.jpg"},{"format_type":0,"link":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_archive11/Content/thumbnail/175210258/175210258_1.jpg","id":545843}],"source":"SLO1","poster":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173252090/poster.jpg","images":{"orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_archive11/Content/thumbnail/175210258/175210258_1.jpg","fp1":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_archive11/Content/thumbnail/175210258/175210258_1_fp1.jpg","fp2":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up