tna zasedba tako z raznoliko glasbeno govorico ustvarja dinamičen dialog med besedo, melodijo in improvizacijo. Predstava se giblje med koncertom, kabaretom in poetičnim gledališčem ter občinstvu ponuja večplastno umetniško izkušnjo, ki Krakarjevo ustvarjanje približuje sodobnemu poslušalcu. V tokratni oddaji bosta gosta Matija Krečič in Lea Likar Praznik spregovorila o samih začetkih projekta, o ideji, ki ga je spodbudila, ter o ustvarjalnem procesu, skozi katerega sta poezijo Lojzeta Krakarja skupaj preoblikovala v glasbeno odrsko pripoved.","publishDate":"2026-09-09 19:20:00","broadcast":{"genreIds":[130,13050,1305050],"keywords":[""],"author":"Alma Čelik","genre":["GLASBENE VSEBINE","DRUGA GLASBA IN GLASBENE ODDAJE","Šanson "],"idec":"21888202","language":["SLO"]},"recordingDate":"2026-09-09 20:21:05","viewTime":"5586","id":"175248320","broadcastDate":"2026-09-09 19:20:00","podcast_thumbnail":{"md":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_1_fp-sq.jpg","pc":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_1_fp-pc.jpg","lg":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_1_fp-mx.jpg","orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_1.jpg"},"source":"ARS","media_thumbnails":[],"showThumbnail":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo.jpg","thumbnail_sec":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo.jpg","subTitle":"Matija Krečič in Lea Likar Praznik v glasbo vtkala poezijo Lojzeta Krakarja (pon)","expirationDate":"2026-10-09 19:20:00","expiresInDays":17,"images":{"orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo.jpg","fp1":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_fp1.jpg","fp2":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_fp2.jpg","fp3":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/173250849/logo_fp3.jpg","thumb":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/17