 v Mariboru bomo pregledali stanje na tem področju in v kolikšni meri lahko nov študijski program razreši pereče razmere.\r\n","podcast_thumbnail_nologo":{"pc":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/logo_fp-pc.jpg","lg":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/logo_fp-mx.jpg","orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/logo.jpg","md":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/logo_fp-sq.jpg"},"showId":"47471518","id":"175241940","score":"1037.3439","showDescription":"Osvetljujemo in raziskujemo področja in teme povezane z jezikom. Gostje oddaje so jezikoslovci, učitelji, prevajalci, informatiki, inženirji, pravniki, zdravniki, psihologi, predstavniki ranljivih skupin idr. ","title":"Kronično pomanjkanje logopedov","showName":"Jezikovni pogovori","duration":"1198","views":"34","podcastLink":"http://podcast.rtvslo.si/jezikovni_pogovori.xml","podcast_thumbnail":{"md":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni-pogovori-1400x1400_fp-sq.jpg","pc":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni-pogovori-1400x1400_fp-pc.jpg","lg":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni-pogovori-1400x1400_fp-mx.jpg","orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni-pogovori-1400x1400.jpg"},"broadcastDate":"2026-08-11 13:58:22","media_thumbnails":[],"source":"ARS","thumbnail_sec":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni_pogovori.jpg","showThumbnail":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni_pogovori.jpg","expirationDate":"3001-01-01 00:00:00","images":{"orig":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni_pogovori.jpg","fp1":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni_pogovori_fp1.jpg","fp2":"https://img.rtvcdn.si/_up/ava/ava_misc/show_logos/47471518/jezikovni_pogovori_fp2.jpg","fp3":"https://img.rtvcdn.si